<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Capital raises full yr shr, div.</title>
<headline>Capital raises full yr shr, div.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year ended December 31.</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, div per unit (shr)   30.28  vs   27.07</p>
<p>    Turnover			48.40  vs   44.68</p>
<p>Total income available</p>
<p>    for distribution	    44.47  vs   38.43</p>
<p>Div payable around February 28</p>
<p>on register February 20</p>
<p>Full name: Capital Property Fund (Financial - property</p>
<p>trusts)</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
